WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Today I'll show you the fastest way to plan a week of content.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
So before we begin, here is the story behind this workflow.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
[silence]

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Before we begin, there is one more piece of context.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:50.000
First, capture every idea in one place and score it by audience intent.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Then group related ideas so each upload creates demand for the next.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:24.000
The scoring step is the payoff: evidence replaces the blank page.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Finally, keep the strongest hook and schedule the week.
